+| `runner/train.py` | 设备初始化、`nccl`→`distributed_backend()`、autocast、GradScaler |
+| `runner/inference.py` | 设备初始化、`nccl`→`distributed_backend()`、autocast、V100 能力检测用 `get_device_capability()` 判空 |
